\", \"q\": \"the area of impact (i.e., the area where the plume extended) was > 200 feet from the point of release\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"data_focus\", \"outcome_types\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}